, 2022.","t_chg":"Ukiah's days and nights both warmed. Nights warmed faster.","p_chg":"Across 125 complete years: Ukiah's average low has risen <strong class='sig'>+0.38\u00b0F per decade</strong> (95% range +0.33 to +0.44), about +5.0\u00b0F since 1893. Ukiah's average high has risen <strong class='sig'>+0.14\u00b0F per decade</strong> (95% range +0.06 to +0.21), about +1.8\u00b0F since 1893.","t_mon":"Lows rose in all 12 months. Highs rose in 5 of 12 months.","t_rain":"Rain: no clear long-term change","p_rain":"Ukiah's yearly precipitation shows no clear long-term change (\u22120.10 inches per decade, a range that includes zero). The 1991\u20132020 normal is 36.4 inches a year. The wettest year was 1998 (67.03 in); the driest, 2013 (7.50 in). Ukiah almost never sees snow (the 1991\u20132020 average is 0.1 inches a winter), so there's no snowfall chart.","show_snow":false,"sig_bars":{"lo":true,"hi":false},"t_year":"2026 so far: 5 daily record highs, no daily record lows"}}